 "sentences": [
  "Laura Gardin Fraser designed this historic coin.",
  "She was the first woman ever credited with designing a US coin.",
  "Congress approved the Alabama Centennial half dollar in 1920.",
  "Originally, the bill proposed commemorative quarters instead of halves.",
  "The coins were delayed until 1921 because of the presidential election.",
  "They ultimately featured Alabama's first governor and its governor at the time."
